  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text {Hint: } a x^2+b x+c=0 \\\\\n& \\text {one root is zero } \\Rightarrow c=0 \\\\\n& a \\neq 0, a=1,2,3, \\ldots 9 \\\\\n& b=0, \\ldots \\ldots .9\n\\end{aligned}$\nNumber of value of $N=9 \\times 10=90$",
